OL,3,GNEWSAVillage to get camera following
OL,4,AHGV petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village in Surrey is set to get a new
OL,7,Fcamera aiming to enforce heavy goods
OL,8,Fvehicles (HGV) restrictions following a
OL,9,Fresidents' petition to the council.
OL,11,FCommunity group Federation of Oxshott
OL,12,FResidents and Associations (Fedora)
OL,13,Flaunched the petition in June and
OL,14,Freceived more than 800 signatures.
OL,16,FSurrey County Council will install one
OL,17,Fautomatic number plate recognition
OL,18,F(ANPR) camera at the Copsem Lane end of
OL,19,Fthe A244, which is expected to run from
OL,20,Fearly 2027.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
